DESC_EN = {
    'bosento-sofa': "An arched bamboo frame wraps a black quilted cushion, giving BOSENTO SOFA its characteristically low seat. Bamboo slats along the back and a diagonal strap at the side add depth, linking the warmth of bamboo with the calm of a contemporary interior.",
    'borsani-sofa': "An arched bamboo frame and ivory-cream cushions give BORSANI its soft presence. Piping and a brown strap define the structure, while bamboo slats across the back add depth. The light, warm palette brings quiet elegance to contemporary living spaces.",
    'wave-sofa': "WAVE’s bamboo strips bend from the backrest down into the seat, then curl over at the front edge. Along the edge, woven rattan crosses into a row of Xs on honey-coloured bamboo. In profile, the hollow of the curve sits clearly above slender steel legs.",
    'embrace-sofa-a': "Embrace takes the shape of a hug. Two leather-wrapped armrests hold a wide seat, and a headrest lies across the gently reclined back. Between the olive-green cushions, the honey bamboo frame still shows every node and grain.",
    'tabouret-chair': "The TABOURET chair is defined by parallel strips that curve from the backrest into the seat. Warm brown tones meet a slender metal base for a compact, airy whole. Its soft lines let the chair settle easily into a contemporary dining room.",
    'gentleman-chair': "GENTLEMAN pairs a slender bamboo frame with a seat and backrest in cognac brown. X-shaped braces accent the open structure, while strap armrests and metal buckles add a refined note. The rhythm of bamboo nodes and the joint details bring warmth to a private sitting room.",
    'captain-chair': "CAPTAIN brings the spirit of the director’s chair into a contemporary form. A dark brown bamboo frame forms a clear X-leg, paired with a seat, backrest and armrests in brown leather. Bronze-toned metal details mark the points where materials meet, for an elegance with a classic edge. On its own or with its footstool, CAPTAIN makes a characterful corner for rest.",
    'baron-chair': "A black leather backrest curves into an arc that joins both armrests. The gap between the arc and the seat lets light through, lightening the chair’s form. On the four dark bamboo legs, the muted gold of brass adds a classic note.",
    'tam-chair': "A loop of bent bamboo wraps around the sitter’s back, then opens forward into two armrests. Below, a woven rattan edge curls softly around the cushion. The wide gap between the bamboo loop and the seat reveals slim steel bars supporting the chair.",
    'commander-chair': "Two dark bamboo armrests run level, then curve down at the front. Within the bamboo frame, the seat and backrest are upholstered in olive-green fabric, separated by an open gap. A slim gold-toned rod, fine as a drawn line, extends the armrests towards the back.",
    'verner-hammock': "Graceful bamboo, an easy pause. VERNER HAMMOCK pairs a tall bamboo frame with a softly draped ivory-cream seat. Crossed bamboo poles form the base, while a knot at the top gives the design its focal point. Warm bamboo and light-coloured fibre evoke a quiet corner close to light and nature.",
    'moonlight-hammock': "An outdoor lounging piece with a gracefully curved bamboo frame and a soft hammock seat, made for light, natural rest. Moonlight Hammock brings refined craftsmanship to any place that calls for a quiet, luxurious point of relaxation.",
    'sandy-chair': "Between two round bamboo armrests, sand-coloured fabric dips gently from the high backrest to the seat. In profile, the curve of the fabric stands out above slender X-shaped legs. At the top, two small loops hold a cognac leather cushion.",
    'beach-hammock-a': "A single line of bamboo runs from the top of the backrest to the front legs, creating the long reclined profile of BEACH HAMMOCK (A). Sand-coloured fabric follows the back, then curves gently at the seat edge. A cognac leather cushion sits neatly between the two round bamboo ends.",
    'beach-hammock-b': "Two brown leather straps connect the backrest to the front bamboo bar, forming the signature diagonal of BEACH HAMMOCK (B). Between the straps, sand-coloured fabric dips gently with the seat. The honey bamboo frame recalls the classic beach chair.",
    'a-line-lamp': "A-LINE combines a bamboo lamp head with a slender black metal frame in a compact, clear-cut form. The curve at the top of the frame softens its straight lines and gives the lamp its signature. Bamboo grain and matte black add depth, making an elegant accent on a side table, bedside or desk.",
    'kink-lamp': "KINK is defined by a folded metal frame and a cylindrical bamboo head. Decisive diagonals meet warm bamboo for a distinctly graphic whole. The side joint and low base are resolved simply, so line and material become the focus of the design.",
}

