ABOUT_EN = {
    've_chung_toi': "At a time when people are returning to values that are lasting, simple and genuine, we believe bamboo – a humble material bound up with Vietnamese culture – deserves to be reborn in a fresh, modern design language. With a love for Vietnamese bamboo and a constant drive to create, our brand was founded to breathe life into every piece of furniture, where the natural beauty and individuality of bamboo meet refinement and everyday ease.\n\nMore than a product, each design is a statement of Vietnamese identity, an affirmation of Vietnamese creativity, and a step on the journey of bringing Vietnamese bamboo furniture to the world – with pride: Vietnamese bamboo, Vietnamese ingenuity.",
    'cau_chuyen_thuong_hieu': "Bamboo – a symbol of the Vietnamese countryside – was once present in every corner of life: from household objects to roofs, fences and the hammock of a summer afternoon. Over time, it slowly disappeared from modern life. In a country with abundant bamboo and skilled, meticulous hands, it is a pity that bamboo has remained a raw material, and that Vietnam has remained a manufacturer for foreign brands. Vietnam has the bamboo, the skills and the dedication, yet has not truly created products made by Vietnamese people, from Vietnamese bamboo, with a Vietnamese design spirit. Bamboo is still tied to traditional stereotypes and thought unsuited to modern design. We believe the opposite.\n\nWe founded this brand to break those old limits, and to show that bamboo can enter contemporary living spaces – not only as a green material, but as a cultural symbol with depth, part of a modern aesthetic. With new design thinking and complete respect for bamboo’s natural, one-of-a-kind character, we create refined, practical furniture with soul: close enough to belong in everyday life, and distinctive enough to hold its own in international markets. This is not only the story of a material, but a journey to bring the value of Vietnamese bamboo and Vietnamese design to the world.",
    'tam_nhin': "We aim to be the pioneering furniture brand that brings Vietnamese bamboo to the world, through modern, practical and sustainable designs with a strong cultural identity. Each piece connects people, nature and tradition, celebrating the simple, unique beauty of bamboo through contemporary design thinking.",
    'su_menh': "We create distinctive, refined furniture of high aesthetic value, where Vietnamese bamboo keeps its rustic beauty while being reinterpreted in a modern, practical and inspiring design language. The brand celebrates traditional bamboo and helps change Vietnam’s place on the global design map, so the world knows Vietnam not only as a place of manufacture, but as a meeting point of precious native materials and deep creative intelligence. Vietnamese bamboo, Vietnamese ingenuity: carrying Vietnamese identity and ambition further.",
    'ben_vung': "By choosing bamboo as our main material, VBAMBOO offers not only a new kind of furniture but a strong commitment to sustainability. Bamboo grows quickly, regenerates easily and is kind to the environment, making it an ideal choice for green living. We see every bamboo piece as a tribute to nature and a reminder of our responsibility to protect the planet. Bamboo furniture stays beautiful over time while reducing harm to the environment. At VBAMBOO, beauty goes hand in hand with sustainability, so every living space can become a place of calm and balance.",
}

